ZaUFBtWU5MUWp6QXh1QmxHX1lnTm55X0FxX1c2azZvcFA4MkJLNktFRml0MnVQTlo5eTNHSmlCRmdLbXBiQngtTTZEcndhZi1jM2h1T1Q4T0VadDFVOGhTSmFBbUdwUTFwT21zRjdHd3RFNTd4RlFqSDV5VkJ1SXhQWkZ3T3puaHNEMnZmVGM4a21KZUhvMkFLdlNJaWxkcGh6a2ZHeGhCZQ?oc=5","date":"2026-10-21","zh":"Cencora 將以 24 億美元的價格收購 American Oncology Network"},{"title":"Cencora to acquire majority stake in $2.4B American Oncology Network","src":"Fierce Healthcare","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxOeWUxR1N3LWFNMG10NGZfc0lxbkd5S2d1NU81SUlLVVpOakh2TEFwanE3cUtkcTQyYk9rWTNFOTZRWmJ3c2c0SVY3NmlCakN4VExzWVR2SGlpcl95NHBPQThMMnF3U095ek9ZX19yWnpOWTRxUUF0MkJsdEMyNGFQZkxmMkZRSXdDN3paZDd3YlJyTzZhYmduNlJyTTJYTXRkMXJv?oc=5","date":"2026-10-21","zh":"Cencora 將收購 $2.4B American Oncology Network 的多數股權"}],"themes":[{"name":"併購","count":4},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":2},{"name":"財報","count":1},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-13","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/315293/000162828026008116/aon-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Aon plc (which may be referred to as \"Aon,\" the \"Company,\" \"we,\" \"us,\" or \"our\") is a leading global professional services firm. Through actionable analytic insight, globally integrated Risk Capital and Human Capital expertise and locally relevant solutions, our colleagues provide clients with the clarity and confidence to make better risk and people decisions that protect and grow their businesses.","zh":"Aon plc（可能被稱為「Aon」、「公司」、「我們」或「我們的」）是一家全球領先的專業服務公司。透過可行的分析洞察、全球整合的風險資本和人力資本專業知識以及本地相關解決方案，我們的同事為客戶提供清晰和信心，以做出更好的風險和人員決策，從而保護和發展他們的業務。"},{"en":"With clients around the world facing growing uncertainty and volatility, we remain focused on accelerating our Aon United strategy to serve clients as one globally connected firm and driving innovation to address unmet and evolving client need. We serve clients in more than 120 countries across all market segments and nearly every industry. This diversification of our client base helps provide our firm with stability in different economic scenarios that could affect specific industries, customer segments, or geographies.","zh":"隨著世界各地的客戶面臨日益增長的不確定性和波動性，我們仍然專注於加速我們的怡安聯合策略，作為一家全球互聯的公司為客戶提供服務，並推動創新，以滿足未滿足和不斷變化的客戶需求。我們為 120 多個國家/地區的所有細分市場和幾乎所有行業的客戶提供服務。我們客戶群的這種多元化有助於為我們公司在可能影響特定行業、客戶群或地區的不同經濟情況下提供穩定性。"},{"en":"We continue to focus our portfolio on higher-margin, capital-light professional services businesses that have high recurring revenue streams and strong cash flow generation. We endeavor to make capital allocation decisions in order to maximize value for Aon and its shareholders.","zh":"我們繼續將投資組合重點放在利潤率較高、資本較少的專業服務業務上，這些業務具有高經常性收入流和強勁的現金流產生能力。我們努力做出資本配置決策，以實現怡安及其股東的價值最大化。"}],"markets":[{"en":"We manage our business within two reportable segments: Risk Capital and Human Capital. In 2025, our consolidated Total revenue was $17,181 million. This includes $11,290 million in Risk Capital and $5,907 million in Human Capital before certain intercompany eliminations.","zh":"我們透過兩個可報告的部門管理我們的業務：風險資本和人力資本。 2025 年，我們的合併總收入為 171.81 億美元。其中包括在某些公司間抵銷之前的 112.9 億美元風險資本和 59.07 億美元人力資本。"},{"en":"Commercial Risk Solutions uses Risk Capital's extensive data and analytics capabilities to provide brokerage and consulting services that help organizations develop, improve, and implement their risk management strategies. Commercial Risk Solutions includes insurance and specialty brokerage, global risk consulting, captives management, and Affinity programs. In insurance brokerage, our dedicated teams of risk professionals utilize comprehensive analytics to design strategically resilient insurance programs and provide our clients access to Aon's proprietary facilities, such as Aon Client Treaty and all other forms of capital, regardless of insurance carrier, placement structure or geography. Throughout the year, we review analytics specific to clients' losses and exposures, and we evaluate new risk transfer techniques to be considered in the current market conditions. Commercial Risk Sol","zh":"Commercial Risk Solutions 利用 Risk Capital 廣泛的數據和分析功能提供經紀和諮詢服務，幫助組織制定、改進和實施其風險管理策略。商業風險解決方案包括保險和專業經紀、全球風險諮詢、自保管理和 Affinity 計劃。在保險經紀領域，我們的專業風險專業團隊利用全面的分析來設計具有戰略彈性的保險計劃，並為我們的客戶提供怡安專有設施的使用權，例如怡安客戶條約和所有其他形式的資本，無論保險公司、安置結構或地理位置如何。在這一年中，我們會審查針對客戶損失和風險敞口的分析，並評估當前市場條件下要考慮的新風險轉移技術。商業風險解決方案"}],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"Our business operates in a highly competitive and fragmented environment. We compete with numerous other global insurance brokers and consulting companies, including, among others, Marsh McLennan, Willis Towers Watson, Arthur J Gallagher & Company, and Lockton Companies, Inc., as well as numerous other global, regional, and local firms in almost every area of our business. We also compete with insurance and reinsurance companies that directly market and service their insurance products without the assistance of brokers or agents. Additionally, we compete with other businesses that do not fall into the categories above, including large financial institutions and independent consulting firms and consulting organizations affiliated with accounting, information systems, technology, human resources, and financial services firms.","zh":"我們的業務在競爭激烈且分散的環境中運作。我們與許多其他全球保險經紀人和顧問公司競爭，其中包括 Marsh McLennan、Willis Towers Watson、Arthur J Gallagher & Company 和 Lockton Companies, Inc.，以及我們業務幾乎每個領域的許多其他全球、區域和本地公司。我們也與保險和再保險公司競爭，這些公司在沒有經紀人或代理人協助的情況下直接行銷和服務其保險產品。此外，我們也與其他不屬於上述類別的企業競爭，包括大型金融機構和獨立顧問公司以及附屬於會計、資訊系統、技術、人力資源和金融服務公司的顧問組織。"},{"en":"Due to buying patterns and delivery of certain products and services in the markets we serve, revenues recognized tend to be higher in the first and fourth quarters of each fiscal year.","zh":"由於我們服務的市場中的購買模式以及某些產品和服務的交付，每個財政年度第一和第四季度確認的收入往往會更高。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Risk Capital","val":11290000000,"zh":"風險資本部門"},{"name":"Human Capital","val":5907000000,"zh":"人力資本部門"}],"total":17181000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":8279000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Europe Middle East & Africa Other Than United Kingdom & Ireland","val":3153000000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲（英國和愛爾蘭除外）"},{"name":"GB","val":2220000000,"zh":"英國"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":1711000000,"zh":"亞太"},{"name":"Americas Other Than United States","val":1633000000,"zh":"美國以外的美洲"},{"name":"IE","val":185000000,"zh":"愛爾蘭"}],"total":17181000000}},"peers":["MRSH","AJG","AIZ","ALLE","AMP"]}}